Package: APPIN
Title: APPIN - Automated 2D NMR Peak Picking and Integration
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Julien", "Guibert", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "julien.guibert@inrae.fr")
Description: Interactive R Shiny application for the analysis of 2D NMR
    spectra: automated peak detection (local maxima + DBSCAN or CNN),
    manual editing, and batch peak integration (Sum, Gaussian, pseudo-Voigt)
    for metabolomics research. Developed at INRAe Toxalim / MetaboHUB.
License: CeCILL-2.1
Encoding: UTF-8
